:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Eva Marija</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><em class=\"text-white/75\">Mother Nature</em></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">—</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">Semi-final</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><strong class=\"text-white\">Montenegro</strong></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Tamara Živković</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><em class=\"text-white/75\">Nova zora</em></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">—</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">Semi-final</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><strong class=\"text-white\">Portugal</strong></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Bandidos do Cante</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><em class=\"text-white/75\">Rosa</em></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">—</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">Semi-final</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><strong class=\"text-white\">San Marino</strong></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Senhit</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><em class=\"text-white/75\">Superstar</em></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">—</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">Semi-final</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><strong class=\"text-white\">Switzerland</strong></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Veronica Fusaro</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\"><em class=\"text-white/75\">Alice</em></td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a class=\"text-euro-pink-light hover:underline\" href=\"/en/eurovision-2026\" data-discover=\"true\">Everything about Eurovision 2026: results, semi-finals, schedule and songs<!-- --> →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Prediction format</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>Each player builds two lists before the host advances the lobby phase:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-white/80\"><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Top 5</strong> — <!-- -->five countries you think will finish highest in the combined jury + televote.</li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Worst 5</strong> — <!-- -->five countries you think will finish lowest.</li></ul><p>Lists are <strong class=\"text-white\">ordered</strong>: a #1 pick that wins scores more than a #5 pick that wins. You cannot put the same country in both lists. Lists lock when the host clicks Advance to Predictions Locked.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Scoring — Top 5</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>For each Top-5 pick, you score against the official combined jury + televote ranking:</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto -mx-4 sm:mx-0\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[480px] text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-left\">Result</th><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-right\">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country at the exact position you predicted</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">50</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country in the official Top 5 but at a different position</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">20</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country outside the Top 5</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><span class=\"text-white/50\">0</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Maximum Top-5 points: 5 exact positions × 50 = <strong class=\"text-white\">250</strong>.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Scoring — Worst 5</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>Worst-5 is symmetrical — last place counts as position 1 in your list:</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto -mx-4 sm:mx-0\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[480px] text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-left\">Result</th><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-right\">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country at the exact bottom position you predicted</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">50</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country in the official Worst 5 but at a different position</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">20</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country outside the Worst 5</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><span class=\"text-white/50\">0</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Maximum Worst-5 points: 250. Combined predictions cap: <strong class=\"text-white\">500</strong>.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Strategy tips</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-white/80\"><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Trust the betting markets, but don’t copy them.</strong> Top-3 favourites usually deliver, but the #4-#10 range is where rankings re-shuffle wildly between jury and televote.</li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Worst 5 is where games are won.</strong> Most players over-think the top and ignore the bottom. Three correct Worst-5 picks = 30 free points.</li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Watch the semi-final running order.</strong> Late slots in the second semi tend to make grand-final spots they don’t deserve — they’re fresh in jury memory.</li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Don’t bet against the host.</strong> Host countries rarely win, but they rarely finish last either.</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 transition-colors\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-0\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-[15px] sm:text-base\">Can I change my list?</span><span class=\"shrink-0 w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-pink-light text-xl transition-transform \" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 transition-colors\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-1\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-[15px] sm:text-base\">What about semi-final exits?</span><span class=\"shrink-0 w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-pink-light text-xl transition-transform \" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 transition-colors\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-2\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-[15px] sm:text-base\">How does the app know the results?</span><span class=\"shrink-0 w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-pink-light text-xl transition-transform \" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></div></div></div></section><aside class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-purple/30 via-euro-purple-dark/40 to-euro-pink/20 px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 sm:py-12 text-center\" role=\"complementary\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Lock your Top 5 before kick-off</h2><p class=\"text-white/75 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6\">Create a room and invite up to 19 friends to predict.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-euro-purple-light to-euro-pink text-white font-bold hover:opacity-95 transition shadow-lg shadow-euro-pink/20\" href=\"/en/?action=create\" data-discover=\"true\">✨ <!-- -->Create</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/[0.06] border border-white/15 text-white font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition\" href=\"/en/how-to-play\" data-discover=\"true\">How to play</a></div></aside><section aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-5\">Ke